    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</strong></i>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power - but choose wisely, for these powers have their drawbacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</strong></i>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power - but choose wisely, for these powers have their drawbacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "BLOOD VIAL is a retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the spilled blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full. Grow increasingly powerful with new upgrades and weapons. Navigate an ever-shifting labyrinth of crypts, catacombs and cathedrals.",
